1
00:00:00,035 --> 00:00:02,955
(Howard:)Preparing to fire laser at the moon.

2
00:00:03,121 --> 00:00:04,451
SHELDON:
Make it so.

3
00:00:09,127 --> 00:00:11,167
(Howard:)There it is. There's the spike.

4
00:00:11,338 --> 00:00:15,088
Two-point-five seconds for the light to
return. That's the moon. We hit the moon.

5
00:00:18,678 --> 00:00:22,308
(Zack:)That's your big experiment?
All that for a line on the screen?

6
00:00:22,932 --> 00:00:25,932
Yeah, but think
about what this represents.

7
00:00:26,102 --> 00:00:29,442
(Leonard:)The fact that we can do this
is the only way of definitively proving...

8
00:00:29,606 --> 00:00:31,856
(Leonard:)...that there are man-made objects
on the moon...

9
00:00:32,025 --> 00:00:34,485
...put there by a species
that only 60 years before...

10
00:00:34,652 --> 00:00:36,652
(Leonard:)...had just invented the airplane.

11
00:00:36,988 --> 00:00:38,658
(Zack:)What species is that?

12
00:00:41,743 --> 00:00:44,033
(Sheldon:)I was wrong. Penny can do better.

13
00:00:44,204 --> 00:00:47,584
(Penny:)-Okay, guys, thank you. It's been fun.
-Yeah, thanks.

14
00:00:47,749 --> 00:00:50,629
(Zack:)-Should we invite them to the party?
-No, just keep walking.

15
00:00:51,795 --> 00:00:56,025
He's must be very skilled at coitus.

